{"synopsis":"Dokter bedah toraks, Lee Jinhyuk, telah mendedikasikan puluhan tahun hidupnya hanya untuk pasiennya. Namun, dia tidak bisa berada di sana untuk saat-saat terakhir ibunya sendiri, menghabiskan malam-malam tanpa tidur yang penuh dengan penyesalan. Namun, ketika ia terbangun, tiba-tiba saja bulan Februari 1998-kembali ke masa-masa magangnya! Di kehidupan keduanya, ia ingin mencurahkan waktunya sepenuhnya untuk keluarganya… Namun, apa pun yang dilakukannya, hidup tenang bukanlah sebuah pilihan!","alternative_title":"회귀 닥터는 조용히 살고 싶었다, Dokter Yang Hidup Kembali Agar Bisa Hidup Dengan Tenang","author":"Tauran, Haejun, BY","artist":"Drawways","chapters":[{"number":"73","chapter":"73","slug":"3d2d616f-811e-48e5-a23d-b28a14cd9c0c","title":"Chapter 73","date":"2026-07-06"},{"number":"72","chapter":"72","slug":"4a239ecf-7553-41d8-b854-349735994e4f","title":"Chapter 72","date":"2026-06-23"},{"number":"71","chapter":"71","slug":"7eef8d01-bd24-43d1-9a11-5e72ff684047","title":"Chapter 71","date":"2026-06-16"},{"number":"70","chapter":"70","slug":"8bffe8ac-6ac6-4d45-b0a2-b1ccc6ae3ed5","title":"Chapter 70","date":"2026-06-13"},{"number":"69","chapter":"69","slug":"62a19375-23fd-47cd-beae-95b28cfcb79f","title":"Chapter 69","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"183494ef-a37e-4241-858b-70f2706076b6","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-06-12"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"6b4e5bcf-c0bf-48f2-ba81-65bd7453d988","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-05-26"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"d02d263d-08cb-478d-b9a7-bf97105a8e9f","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-05-24"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"bed8197e-507b-4a1c-a393-7cd1ed59d87d","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"bab04894-b29c-436b-ae08-49d3a8ccd875","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-05-18"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"77225f04-dc86-4ebb-88c2-c46a39a2fd09","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-04-24"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","sl